# Band boundaries: Unicode CLDR 47 Day Period Rules, locale fi
# (https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/47/supplemental/day_periods.html),
# transcribed in chronologia/dayparts.py as iltapaiva [12:00, 18:00)
# (CLDR afternoon1).
# Surface: iltapäivällä, the adessive of iltapäivä "afternoon".
# Source: Wiktionary, "iltapäivällä": adessive singular of "iltapäivä".
# https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/iltap%C3%A4iv%C3%A4ll%C3%A4
# CLDR 47 fi names this period "iltapäivällä" in the format-wide day periods.
# The same surface is the pm meridiem (clock_meridiem_pm.voc).
iltapäivällä
